face by herself sally's still  alive somehow surviving a chainsaw  through the stomach and being tossed  like a ragdoll but she'll succumb to her  injuries leaving lila to pick up the  shotgun and hunt leatherface in an old  abandoned movie theater where of course  one of my favorite films is playing  werewolves of the alambo too lila  battles leatherface and when it looks  like all is lost melody appears with his  chainsaw to save the day she somehow  disimpaled herself un impaled i don't  know so the two end up defeating  leatherface together and venturing back  home to austin texas proving that  utopias are frivolous fantasies that  will get crushed by a man wearing a  woman's face as a mask and when all  looks hunky-dory and they're gonna get  out alive leatherface smashes into the  car ripping melody out and cutting her  head off faster than you can say king  henry viii it's a pretty cool shot  because the car is on autopilot so it  just kind of slowly drives away as lila  watches in horror at our decapitated  sister there's even a fun nod to the  original as leatherface does his weird  leather dance but if you're a masochist  like myself you'll have stayed through  the credits and seen this short  post-credit sequence there's nothing  quite revelatory here other than the  fact it shows leatherface is still alive  and working his way back home this is  the same home from the original movie  you can tell by the windmill to the left  and the two chimney stacks so who knows  if leatherface has any family still back  there and what chapter of horror awaits  us next that's it for texas chainsaw  massacre i want to hear what you thought  about this sequel in the comments below  thanks for watching everyone be sure to  like and subscribe and for more bad  takes you can follow me on twitter and  instagram at think story yt until next  time remember try anything you cancel  bro

